The new-session screen is a place: while its unsent draft holds text or
attachments, New Chat keeps the current fresh draft key instead of rotating
to an empty bucket. The key rotates once the draft is sent or emptied.
Flushes the live editor first when already on the new-session screen so
debounced keystrokes count.
